---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'For Travel Agents | Malaysian Food Tours B2B Partner',
  description: 'Book authentic Malaysian food experiences for your clients. Culinary Travel Experts offers curated food tours, heritage walks, and cultural experiences across Malaysia. Licensed DMC with 14 years of relationships.',
  image: 'https://cdn.simplyenak.com/payload-media/hand-dipping-lumpia-in-penang-laksa.jpg',
  canonical: 'https://culinarytravelexperts.com/for-agents',
  robots: {
    index: true,
    follow: true,
  },
};

const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: [
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'What types of food experiences do you offer for travel agents?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'We offer multi-day itineraries, day experiences, custom trips, corporate events, and itinerary planning services across Kuala Lumpur, Penang, Ipoh, Melaka, Cameron Highlands, and Johor Bahru.',
      },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'How do I book food tours for my clients?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'Sign our supplier agreement, receive our trade kit with destination guides and pricing, then book experiences for your clients. We handle all logistics and guest communication.',
      },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'What makes your food tours different from TripAdvisor or GetYourGuide?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'We build experiences around relationships, not routes. Your clients meet the families we have worked with for years, not standardized tours from the same meeting points.',
      },
    },
  ],
};
---

<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">For Travel Agents</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-muted mb-8">
        Your clients ask for things that don't fit a package. We help you say yes, and you earn commission on every booking.
      </p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-card p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">20-25% commission</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">On tour bookings. Private and custom experiences at 15%. Clear, written, and paid on time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-card p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">We handle everything</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">Guest communication, dietary coordination, day-of logistics, language support. You sell, we operate.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-card p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">Rated 5.0 on Google</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">81 guest reviews across Kuala Lumpur and Penang. Real people, real names, real experiences.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-12">
        <h2>Say yes to the request. We handle the rest.</h2>
        <p>
          A client wants a halal food tour with a durian tasting for a group of 12, plus a cooking class, in Penang, three weeks from now. That request does not fit a brochure. It fits us.
        </p>
        <p>
          Since 2011 we have built the relationships that make complex requests simple: vendors who know us by name, guides who have led hundreds of tours, and a logistics team that coordinates dietary needs, transport, and timing before your client even lands.
        </p>
        <p>
          You are not selling a standardized product. You are selling access to people: the market vendors, home cooks, and families who have been feeding their communities for generations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-card p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">What Your Clients Experience</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-muted">
            <li>Breakfast at a 40-year-old kopi tiam with the owner</li>
            <li>Watch a vendor prepare their specialty before the market opens</li>
            <li>Eat char kway teow at a stall where the wok hei is so good locals line up at 6am</li>
            <li>Try cendol made with palm sugar from a farm two hours north of Penang</li>
            <li>Leave with the contact of a family that will welcome them back</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-card p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">What We Handle</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-muted">
            <li><strong>Guest communication:</strong> Pre-tour instructions, meeting point details</li>
            <li><strong>Dietary needs:</strong> Halal, vegetarian, vegan, allergies, coordinated with vendors</li>
            <li><strong>Day-of support:</strong> English, Malay, Mandarin, Cantonese-speaking guides</li>
            <li><strong>Problem-solving:</strong> If something goes wrong, we fix it</li>
            <li><strong>Post-tour:</strong> Follow-up messages, feedback collection</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-12">
        <h2>What agents say about working with us</h2>
        <blockquote>
          "Great tour of Georgetown's culinary delights with Gary, ending in a fun evening out. Recommend you do this early in your stay so you can go back and visit some of the restaurants again!"
          <footer>Anita Law, guest review, Google</footer>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote>
          "I joined the tour with Pauline and I highly recommend this KL street food tour to anyone looking for a local and personal experience! Pauline not only takes you to all the local street vendors to taste the delicious food that locals eat, but also shares the stories behind each dish."
          <footer>Janne Maas, guest review, Google</footer>
        </blockquote>
        <p>
          These are guest reviews, but they are what your clients will read before they book. When you sell with us, you are selling a 5.0-rated experience, not a promise.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-primary/10 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">For High-Volume Partners</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">
          Agencies that regularly book with us receive priority access to our most sought-after experiences, co-branded marketing materials, and a dedicated account manager.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">
          We invest in partners who invest in delivering exceptional experiences to their clients.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-12">
        <h2>How to Partner With Us</h2>
        <ol class="space-y-3">
          <li><strong>Sign our supplier agreement</strong>. Standard terms that protect both parties and ensure we maintain our quality standards</li>
          <li><strong>Receive our trade kit</strong>. Destination guides, photos, marketing copy you can use</li>
          <li><strong>Book experiences for your clients</strong>. We handle all logistics and guest communication</li>
          <li><strong>Build a long-term partnership</strong>. Priority access and dedicated support for high-volume partners</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <section id="contact" class="py-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Request the Trade Kit</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 max-w-4xl">
          <form>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <input type="text" placeholder="Name" required class="block w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-accent focus:border-accent text-default" />
              <input type="email" placeholder="Email" required class="block w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-accent focus:border-accent text-default" />
              <textarea placeholder="Tell us about your requirements" rows="4" class="block w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-accent focus:border-accent text-default"></textarea>
              <button type="submit" class="px-6 py-3 bg-primary text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-secondary transition-colors cursor-pointer">Request Trade Kit</button>
            </div>
          </form>
          <div class="space-y-8">
            <div><h3 class="font-bold font-heading text-lg">Email</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1"><a href="mailto:hello@culinarytravelexperts.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@culinarytravelexperts.com</a></p></div>
            <div><h3 class="font-bold font-heading text-lg">Based In</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1">Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-muted mt-4 text-sm">We respond within 24 hours. No obligation to join.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

